{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Stamp every event with the app, device, operating system, locale and network connection it was tracked on."}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/standardcontext"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each standard value has an enricher of its own, and nothing is added to a record until the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"builds its tracker with that enricher. Each one sets a typed "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"type":"text","text":" key whose value a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination reads from the record’s context: "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/ApplicationKey"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/DeviceKey"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/OperatingSystemKey"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/LocaleKey"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/NetworkKey"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/VendorIdentifierKey"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The app, device, operating system and locale are read once, when the enricher is made, never per","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event. The network connection changes while the app runs, so on Apple platforms ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"network()"},{"text":" starts","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NWPathMonitor"},{"text":" of its own and sets the latest connection on each record. Give each tracker its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"own call. Off Apple platforms there is no device and no path monitor, so those two enrichers set","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"nothing, and a server or tool, whose process usually has no Info.plist, passes its own app to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"application(_:)"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vendorIdentifier()"},{"type":"text","text":", made on the main actor, adds the platform’s identifier for vendor as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sensitive"},{"type":"text","text":" value. It is the one identifier here that outlives a session, so add it only when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app has decided to and has the user’s consent. It is never stored or made up: on macOS and Linux,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which have none, records carry no key."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For the session an event was tracked in, use "},{"code":"Sessions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import StandardContext","import Trackers","","let tracker = Tracker(enrichers: [.application(), .operatingSystem(), .locale(), .network()])","tracker.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","\/\/ A destination reads each value from the record's context:","\/\/ record.context[ApplicationKey.self]?.version, record.context[OperatingSystemKey.self]?.name"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The guide ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/sessionsandstandardcontext","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"covers each value and the identifier for vendor in more detail.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"StandardContext"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","title":"StandardContext","externalID":"StandardContext","symbolKind":"module"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/application(_:)","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/ApplicationKey"],"title":"The app","anchor":"The-app"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/device(_:)","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/DeviceKey"],"title":"The device","anchor":"The-device"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/operatingSystem(_:)","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/OperatingSystemKey"],"title":"The operating system","anchor":"The-operating-system"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/locale(_:)","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/LocaleKey"],"title":"The locale","anchor":"The-locale"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/network()","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/NetworkKey"],"title":"The network connection","anchor":"The-network-connection"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/vendorIdentifier()","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/VendorIdentifierKey"],"title":"The identifier for vendor","anchor":"The-identifier-for-vendor"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documenta